# Optional. Without a key, Ilsa runs entirely on its no-key rule-based interpreter.
# With a key, Claude reads answers and suggests findings; every suggestion still passes
# the same deterministic checks, and any API failure falls back to the no-key interpreter.
# Uses your own paid Anthropic API account.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ILSA_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
# PORT=3100
# HOST=127.0.0.1
# ILSA_DATA_DIR=./data
